unty"],["ARC or PLC in Eastland County","/arc-plc/texas/eastland-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Eastland County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, February to March and March to April each came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 150% of normal in April to May and 36% in February to March. Grid 15124 had its driest year in 1956 at 45% of normal.</p>"}
